{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"dd46d76c08bdc9f6","__entryId":"image","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:130px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"height:74px;background:url('/assets/cover-workspace.png') center/cover\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 10px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">桌面升降台</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">¥1,299</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:130px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"height:74px;background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 10px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">户外登山包 40L</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">¥459</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><b style=\"color:var(--text)\">林小hu</b> · 2 小时前</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;margin-top:2px\">这组场景图太直观了，已抄进团队规范 👍</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><b style=\"color:var(--text)\">ans-studio</b> · 5 小时前</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;margin-top:2px\">正愁怎么跟新人解释空状态，转发了</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:8px\">文章配图（悬停出现预览遮罩）：</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <div style=\"position:relative;width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:url('/assets/photo-cat.png') center/cover\">\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.45);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px\">🔍 预览</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-hover);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px;flex:none\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:18px\">🖼️</span>图片加载失败\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7\">alt=\"山间徒步路线实拍\" —— 加载失败时仍显示占位和说明文字。</div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:130px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"height:74px;background:url('/assets/cover-workspace.png') center/cover\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 10px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Desktop lifting table</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">¥1,299</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:130px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"height:74px;background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 10px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Outdoor mountaineering bag 40L</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">¥459</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><b style=\"color:var(--text)\">Alex Chen</b> · 2 hours ago</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;margin-top:2px\">This set of scene diagrams is so intuitive that it has been copied into the team specifications 👍</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><b style=\"color:var(--text)\">maya-lee</b> · 5 hours ago</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;margin-top:2px\">Zhengchou how to explain the empty status to newcomers, forwarded</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:8px\">Article image (preview mask appears when hovering):</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <div style=\"position:relative;width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:url('/assets/photo-cat.png') center/cover\">\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.45);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px\">🔍 Preview</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-hover);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px;flex:none\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:18px\">🖼️</span> Image loading failed\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7\">alt=\"Mountain Hiking Route Real Shots\" —— Placeholder and explanatory text are still displayed when loading fails. </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"im-box\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"img\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0\"><span class=\"im-photo\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"mask\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:22px\"><span class=\"im-mask\" style=\"position:static;height:100%;font-size:12px\">🔍 预览</span></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"im-box\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"img\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0\"><span class=\"im-photo\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"mask\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:22px\"><span class=\"im-mask\" style=\"position:static;height:100%;font-size:12px\">🔍 Preview</span></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"root","cn":"图片容器","en":"Image","desc":"决定尺寸和裁切方式","desc_en":"Decide on size and cut"},{"key":"img","cn":"图片本体","en":"Img","desc":"真正展示的内容","desc_en":"What is really shown"},{"key":"mask","cn":"预览遮罩","en":"Mask","desc":"悬停出现，点击放大","desc_en":"Hover to appear, click to enlarge"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"裁剪填充","en":"Cover","demo":"<div class=\"im-box\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"im-box\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div>","when":"容器比例固定，宁可裁掉也不变形","when_en":"The proportion of the container is fixed and it would rather be cut off than deformed."},{"cn":"完整显示","en":"Contain","demo":"<div class=\"im-box im-contain\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"im-box im-contain\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div>","when":"图的内容不能裁，留边也要看全","when_en":"The content of the picture cannot be cropped, and the whole picture must be read even if the margins are left."},{"cn":"圆形头像","en":"Circle","demo":"<div class=\"im-box im-circle\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"im-box im-circle\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div>","when":"头像专用，圆角裁成圆形","when_en":"Special for avatars, cut into rounded corners"},{"cn":"加载失败","en":"Fallback","demo":"<div class=\"im-box fail\"><span class=\"im-fallback\">⚠<br>加载失败</span></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"im-box fail\"><span class=\"im-fallback\">⚠<br>Loading failed</span></div>","when":"图片加载出错时的兜底占位","when_en":"Placeholder when image loading error occurs"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>封面、头像、商品图</b>等常见图片展示场景","m":"image-cover"},{"t":"需要<b>点击放大</b>看细节，自带预览交互","m":"image-preview"},{"t":"图片可能<b>加载失败</b>，要有兜底占位","m":"image-fallback"},{"t":"容器比例固定，图片<b>裁切填充不变形</b>","m":"image-fit"}],"dont":[{"t":"按指定宽高<b>强制拉伸</b>，导致图片比例失真","m":"image-stretch","bad":true},{"t":"大量图片<b>同时加载</b>，明显阻塞页面响应","m":"image-many","bad":true},{"t":"把<b>标题文字只做进图里</b>，搜索和读屏无法读取","m":"image-text","bad":true},{"t":"缺少 <b>alt 描述</b>，加载失败后无法说明图片内容","m":"image-noalt","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"商品卡片的原图比例不同，图片加载后卡片会突然变高，部分图片还被拉伸。应该怎样处理？","options":[{"id":"reserved-ratio-image","label":"先预留统一比例的图片区域，再按比例裁切，并为内容图提供文字说明","feedback":"预留尺寸能减少加载跳动，按比例裁切避免变形，文字说明覆盖加载失败和非视觉阅读。","correct":true},{"id":"forced-width-height","label":"给所有原图写相同宽度和高度，让浏览器直接拉伸填满区域","feedback":"尺寸统一了，但强制改变长宽比会让商品外观失真，影响用户判断。","correct":false},{"id":"natural-size-late","label":"不预留图片空间，等每张原图加载完成后按自然尺寸撑开卡片","feedback":"保留原比例却会在加载过程中不断改变卡片高度，导致内容位置跳动。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Product card images have different source ratios. Cards jump taller after loading and some images stretch. How should this be handled?","options":[{"id":"reserved-ratio-image","label":"Reserve a consistent ratio, crop proportionally, and provide text alternatives for content images","feedback":"Reserved dimensions reduce layout shift, proportional cropping avoids distortion, and text covers failures and nonvisual reading.","correct":true},{"id":"forced-width-height","label":"Give every source the same width and height and let the browser stretch it to fill","feedback":"The boxes become consistent, but changing aspect ratio distorts products and can mislead visual judgment.","correct":false},{"id":"natural-size-late","label":"Reserve no image space and let each natural image size expand its card after loading","feedback":"Original ratios remain intact, but card heights change during loading and make surrounding content jump.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请统一商品卡片的图片容器比例，加载前就预留空间，图片用等比裁切而不是拉伸。内容图片补充有意义的 alt，加载失败显示兜底；用横图、竖图和慢速网络检查不变形、不跳动。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Use one aspect ratio for product-card image containers and reserve the space before load. Crop proportionally instead of stretching, add meaningful alt text, and provide a failure fallback. Test landscape, portrait, and slow-network cases."}},"references":[{"title":"<img>：图像嵌入元素","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/img","title_en":"<img>: The Image Embed element"},{"title":"学习图片","source":"web.dev","url":"https://web.dev/learn/images","title_en":"Learn Images"}],"scenes":["商品封面","用户头像","点击放大预览","加载失败兜底"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Product and article media","m":"image-cover"},{"t":"Profile or team photos","m":"image-preview"},{"t":"Responsive thumbnails","m":"image-fallback"},{"t":"Images that need preview or loading states","m":"image-fit"}],"dont":[{"t":"Stretch an image into the wrong ratio","m":"image-stretch","bad":true},{"t":"Load full-size files for tiny thumbnails","m":"image-many","bad":true},{"t":"Leave a broken-image icon with no fallback","m":"image-text","bad":true},{"t":"Write alternative text that adds no useful meaning","m":"image-noalt","bad":true}],"scenes":["Product photo","Article cover","Gallery preview","User profile"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:130px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"height:74px;background:url('/assets/cover-workspace.png') center/cover\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 10px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Desktop lifting table</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">¥1,299</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:130px;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n        <div style=\"height:74px;background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 10px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Outdoor mountaineering bag 40L</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--red);font-weight:600;margin-top:2px\">¥459</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><b style=\"color:var(--text)\">Alex Chen</b> · 2 hours ago</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;margin-top:2px\">This set of scene diagrams is so intuitive that it has been copied into the team specifications 👍</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"><b style=\"color:var(--text)\">maya-lee</b> · 5 hours ago</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;margin-top:2px\">Zhengchou how to explain the empty status to newcomers, forwarded</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:8px\">Article image (preview mask appears when hovering):</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <div style=\"position:relative;width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:url('/assets/photo-cat.png') center/cover\">\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.45);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:12px\">🔍 Preview</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;background:url('/assets/cover-mountain.png') center/cover\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:120px;height:80px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-hover);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px;flex:none\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:18px\">🖼️</span> Image loading failed\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7\">alt=\"Mountain Hiking Route Real Shots\" —— Placeholder and explanatory text are still displayed when loading fails. </div>\n    </div>"],"distinctions":[{"label":"Icon","text":"{c:image} shows a photo, illustration, or the content itself. {c:icon} is a small reusable symbol for an action or status.","targetId":"icon"},{"label":"Video","text":"{c:image} is one static frame. {c:video} has time-based content such as play, pause, duration, and sound.","targetId":"video"}],"variants":[{"demo":"<div class=\"im-box\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div>","when":"The proportion of the container is fixed and it would rather be cut off than deformed."},{"demo":"<div class=\"im-box im-contain\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div>","when":"The content of the picture cannot be cropped, and the whole picture must be read even if the margins are left."},{"demo":"<div class=\"im-box im-circle\"><div class=\"im-photo\"></div></div>","when":"Special for avatars, cut into rounded corners"},{"demo":"<div class=\"im-box fail\"><span class=\"im-fallback\">⚠<br>Loading failed</span></div>","when":"Placeholder when image loading error occurs"}]},"usageMocks":{"image-cover":"<div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:38px;height:26px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">封面</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:30px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">商品图</span></div>","image-preview":"<div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:26px;height:18px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">缩略图</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">→ 点击</span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:30px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">放大预览</span></div>","image-fallback":"<div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:40px;height:26px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg-hover);color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px;flex:none\">⚠ 加载失败</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">加载失败时显示占位和说明</span></div>","image-fit":"<div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);flex:none\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:150px\">容器是方的，图是宽的，裁切填充不变形</span></div>","image-stretch":"<div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:44px;height:18px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);flex:none\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">强制拉伸宽高，图片比例失真</span></div>","image-many":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:16px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">大量图片同时加载，会明显阻塞页面响应</span></div>","image-text":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:124px;height:22px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#9ec8ff,#165dff);color:#fff;font-size:12px;flex:none\">新品发布会 · 限时 5 折</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">文字只存在于图片中，搜索和读屏无法读取</span></div>","image-noalt":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:44px;height:28px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg-hover);color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px;flex:none\">⚠ 加载失败</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">缺少 alt，加载失败后无法说明图片内容</span></div>"}}}